[
  {"index": 1, "translated_text": "[A1][/A1]名称 (NAME)"},
  {"index": 2, "translated_text": "raise — 向正在执行的进程发送信号"},
  {"index": 3, "translated_text": "[A2][/A2]概要 (SYNOPSIS)"},
  {"index": 4, "translated_text": "[CODE3]"},
  {"index": 5, "translated_text": "[A4][/A4]说明 (DESCRIPTION)"},
  {"index": 6, "translated_text": "[I5]raise[/I5]() 函数应向正在执行的 [S7][[A8]CX[/A8]][/S7] [IMG9] &nbsp;线程或进程发送信号 [I6]sig[/I6]。[IMG10] 如果调用了信号处理程序，则 [I11]raise[/I11]() 函数在信号处理程序返回之前不应返回。"},
  {"index": 7, "translated_text": "[S12][[A13]CX[/A13]][/S12] [IMG14] [I15]raise[/I15]() 函数的效果应等同于调用："},
  {"index": 8, "translated_text": "[A16][/A16]返回值 (RETURN VALUE)"},
  {"index": 9, "translated_text": "成功完成后，应返回 0。否则，应返回非零值 [S17][[A18]CX[/A18]][/S17] [IMG19] &nbsp;并设置 [I20]errno[/I20] 以指示错误。[IMG21]"},
  {"index": 10, "translated_text": "[A22][/A22]错误 (ERRORS)"},
  {"index": 11, "translated_text": "在以下情况下，[I23]raise[/I23]() 函数应失败："},
  {"index": 12, "translated_text": "[EINVAL]"},
  {"index": 13, "translated_text": "[S24][[A25]CX[/A25]][/S24] [IMG26] [I27]sig[/I27] 参数的值是无效的信号编号。[IMG28]"},
  {"index": 14, "translated_text": "[A29][/A29]示例 (EXAMPLES)"},
  {"index": 15, "translated_text": "无。"},
  {"index": 16, "translated_text": "[A30][/A30]应用程序使用 (APPLICATION USAGE)"},
  {"index": 17, "translated_text": "无。"},
  {"index": 18, "translated_text": "[A31][/A31]原理说明 (RATIONALE)"},
  {"index": 19, "translated_text": "术语 &quot;线程&quot; 是对 ISO&nbsp;C 标准的扩展。"},
  {"index": 20, "translated_text": "[A32][/A32]未来方向 (FUTURE DIRECTIONS)"},
  {"index": 21, "translated_text": "无。"},
  {"index": 22, "translated_text": "[A33][/A33]另见 (SEE ALSO)"},
  {"index": 23, "translated_text": "[A34][I35]kill[/I35]()[/A34]、[A36][I37]sigaction[/I37]()[/A36]"},
  {"index": 24, "translated_text": "XBD [A38][I39]&lt;signal.h&gt;[/I39][/A38]、[A40][I41]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I41][/A40]"},
  {"index": 25, "translated_text": "[A42][/A42]变更历史 (CHANGE HISTORY)"},
  {"index": 26, "translated_text": "首次发布于 Issue 4。源自 ANSI&nbsp;C 标准。"},
  {"index": 27, "translated_text": "[A43][/A43]第 5 版 (Issue 5)"},
  {"index": 28, "translated_text": "DESCRIPTION（说明）部分已更新，以与 POSIX 线程扩展保持一致。"},
  {"index": 29, "translated_text": "[A44][/A44]第 6 版 (Issue 6)"},
  {"index": 30, "translated_text": "超出 ISO&nbsp;C 标准的扩展已标记。"},
  {"index": 31, "translated_text": "以下对 POSIX 实现的新要求源自与 Single UNIX Specification 的一致性："},
  {"index": 32, "translated_text": "在 RETURN VALUE（返回值）部分，添加了出错时设置 [I45]errno[/I45] 的要求。"},
  {"index": 33, "translated_text": "添加了 [EINVAL] 错误条件。"},
  {"index": 34, "translated_text": "[A46][/A46]第 7 版 (Issue 7)"},
  {"index": 35, "translated_text": "与 Threads 选项相关的功能被移到 Base。"},
  {"index": 36, "translated_text": "&nbsp;"}
]
